The [[Prismatic Orb]] is a godly [[Accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. At the start of battle, it has a few effects depending on the item-types placed around it in its diamond-shaped {{icon/star}} zone. {{icon/magic}}-items around it will generate {{icon/mana}}, {{icon/vampiric}}-items around it will generate {{icon/vampirism}}, {{icon/holy}}-items around it will increase healing effectiveness, and {{icon/dark}}-items around it will inflict a random debuff. It will also gain the player one of each type of buff infrequently.

For the cost, these effects are somewhat minor, but the [[Prismatic Orb]] has multiple powerful crafts:

Combining a [[Prismatic Orb]] with a [[Wooden Sword]] grants the [[Prismatic Sword]], which deals very high base damage and has some additional effects for {{icon/magic}}, {{icon/vampiric}}, {{icon/holy}}, or {{icon/dark}}-items around it.

Combining a [[Prismatic Orb]] with a [[Jynx torquilla]] grants the [[Paradise Birb]], which is an improved [[Jynx torquilla]] that also duplicates buffs and improves healing.

[[Mage]]s can additionally combine a [[Prismatic Orb]] with a [[Wand of Equilibrium]] to create a [[Prismatic Wand]], which a powerful buff-gaining machine.
